    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0281c3b713bec83b2f2b09e",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "展现出足以颠覆泥地界常识的实力\\n希望能看到她夺得泥地短途女王的桂冠",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d960b40b88d54023581dd8770acb90fe43fd3e7637a36e311e77e06acc2a94",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4043"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9fe248f1755ffda3abc5a921",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "展现出不输给海外选手的速度\\n希望能看到她夺下草地短途王者的称号",
      "source_fingerprint": "25c289ae3d33e187c6b8c1117f37aa3e49b2ee23ce4c0048a6ec08fc85812760",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4044"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf69cccc0401c194a58cc21c",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "希望她能够展现出足以让在场泥地女杰们惊叹的\\n改变历史的奔跑",
      "source_fingerprint": "d4e0a9525486f09e8fbbc91ce909a521aaea6a7c83c1aeb4b18617f7889ac28d",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4045"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a42520a9996684c8ae230f0",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "在世界最高水平的舞台上，期待她能代表日本赛事界\\n展现出精彩绝伦的跑法",
      "source_fingerprint": "066b4c0ac0b12a72d8e660a0a2235dcbea9f1708e74d184e3008a888a302e627",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4046"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1184ba3e19ebb52de01a9b80",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "在终于抵达的泥地赛事顶峰\\n希望能看到她展现出问鼎世界第一的姿态",
      "source_fingerprint": "03e39a5bbcf4860b7d8686c9f35e7446bf3b76a1646eb4b5c5aad65f8ced644c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4047"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f92023003bdae667608687d8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "将磨砺至今的实力展现给世界\\n希望她能成为在异国他乡也备受喜爱的女王",
      "source_fingerprint": "a8e1f7a51c4f7f8fafc714e9b79d60ab9798b855bbf5d01cbf8d229ff992a45c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4048"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c5ac6a0fb646523a03742cb",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "在这场决定泥地短途界王者的比赛中\\n希望能看到她向世界展示引以为傲的飞快速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "3503cc22f8e4c262d88e985facec53f614c4bad52d392b994066cc009dc2bd81",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4049"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1988e5cef2925b0c9cde79a8",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "击败那些在英里赛赌上一切的对手们\\n真希望能看到她凯旋而归的身影啊",
      "source_fingerprint": "c07a7ee034b4debd5865d14926d3fb7016db1f5fc6ad0a4a84413a7df84c79a4",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4050"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73153dbca831ede260b3890d",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "压制那些泥地8浪的专家们\\n期待她能展现出刻在粉丝心中的跑法",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f1961a28169b1c87dbe312029a7c845e13ff24a9058726ec24d049270e4f94a",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52258f1bd6a2d90ab5b145a7",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "背负着日本粉丝们的期待\\n即使在异国他乡也展现出了轻快的跑姿呢",
      "source_fingerprint": "41fc9b106309cf28be2cc3671734f4de955105977b5545bd4d10fbfd3b4fc03c",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be3e408a906dbdb12dfaeaa9",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "占据了不错的位置呢\\n在异国的舞台上似乎也能充分发挥实力",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f5b063cff413ce3e925b00e6a7fa7179e6f2190d4d49de3fb1ee6108bd634d0",
      "source_path": "race_jikkyo_comment_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "4053"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6930770a21cf2bd0f1d6bd81",
      "kind": "race_jikkyo_comment",
      "source_text": "位置稍微靠后呢\\n正虎视眈眈地觊觎着世界第一的宝座",
